# API Changelog v1 vs. v1


## API Changes

### POST /pets/{petId}
- :warning: removed the media type `application/xml` from the request body
- :warning: removed the request property `'single'`
- :warning: removed the request property `id/no`
- :warning: removed the request property `id/tag`
- :warning: removed the request property `line1
line2`
- :warning: removed the request property `pet`
-  the `id` request property `type` changed from `object` to `string` (backward compatible)






